<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;0,900;1,100;1,400;1,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <% if(data.cssFix){ %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/cssFix.css" />
    <% } %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <img class="qr-image" src="<%= data.src %>" alt="" />
    <div class="main__printing">
      Receipt Printing Date:
      <br />
      <%=data.receiptDate%>
    </div>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="logo logo__hr">
        <img src="/images1/Puducherry.png" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <div class="content__top">
          <h3 class="content__heading">GOVERNMENT OF PUDUCHERRY</h3>
          <p class="content__title">Department of Transport</p>
          <p class="content__desc">Checkpost Tax e-Receipt</p>
        </div>

        <table>
          <tr class="r1 r11">
            <td class="r1-1">Registration No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <b><%=data.vehicleNo%></b></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r12">
            <td class="r1-1">Receipt No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%=data.receiptNo%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r13">
            <td class="r1-1">Payment Date</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%=data.upPaymentDate%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r14">
            <td class="r1-1">Owner Name</td>
            <td class="r1-2">: <%=data.ownerName%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r15">
            <td class="r1-1">Chassis No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.chassisNo%></td>
            <td>Tax Mode</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.taxMode%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r16">
            <td class="r1-1">Vehicle Type.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">
              &nbsp;&nbsp;:
              <div class="r16-3"><%=data.vehiclePermitType%></div>
            </td>
            <td>Vehicle Class</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.vehicleClass%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r17">
            <td class="r1-1">Mobile No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.mobileNo%></td>
            <td>Checkpost Name</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.borderBarrier%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r18">
            <td class="r1-1">Sleeper Cap.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.sleeperCap%></td>
            <% if(data.vehiclePermitType === 'GOODS VEHICLE'){ %>
            <td>Gross Weight</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.grossVehicleWeight%> KG.</td>
            <% }else{ %>
            <td>
              Seating Cap(Ex. <br />
              Driver
            </td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.seatingCapacityExcludingDriver%></td>
            <% } %>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r19">
            <td class="r1-1">Bank Ref. No.</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.upBankRefNo%></td>
            <td>Payment Mode</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.paymentMode%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r20">
            <td class="r1-1">Service Type</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.serviceType%></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="r1 r21">
            <td class="r1-1">Permit Type</td>
            <td class="r1-2">&nbsp;&nbsp;: <%=data.permitType%></td>
            <td>Permit Category</td>
            <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;:</td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="content__money">
          <div class="content__money-r1 d-flex">
            <div class="m1"><b>Particular</b></div>
            <div class="m2"><b>Fees/Tax</b></div>
            <div class="m3"><b>Fine</b></div>
            <div class="m4"><b>Total</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="content__money-r2 d-flex">
            <div class="m1">
              MV Tax( <%=data.taxFrom_up%> TO <%=data.taxTo_up%> )
            </div>
            <div class="m2"><%=data.totalAmount%></div>
            <div class="m3">0</div>
            <div class="m4"><%=data.totalAmount%></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content__amount">
          <div class="content__amount-r1">
            <div class="a1">
              Amount in Words: <%=data.totalAmountInWord%> ONLY</div>
          </div>
          <div class="content__amount-r2">
            <div class="a1">
              Paid Upto: <%=data.taxTo_up%>
            </div>
            <div class="a2">Total Paid: <%=data.totalAmount%></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content__last">
          <div class="content__last-title">
            <p>Condition for Acceptance of Payment of Tax</p>
          </div>
          <div class="content__last-text">
            <p>
              1. The Tax so recovered is subject to verification of documents and
              loading capacity of vehicle. In case of any false information
              pertaining to the documents such as vehicle particulars, the tax,
              penalty and other charges collected shall be adjusted against tax
              due and balance collected from the vehicle owner/user.
            </p>
            <br />
            <p>
              2. Checkpost authorities reserve the right to cancel or modify the
              entire tax in case where the owner of the vehicle or driver provide
              false information in the payment of tax. Any excess payment shall
              be refunded back to the vehicle owner/user on reconciliation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
